style='page-break-before:always'>
Guild Meetings</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Verdana'>The Lost Cabal will hold
meetings every 2 weeks. We will try to rotate the days so everyone has a chance
to attend as often as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Verdana'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p style='margin:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Verdana'>Issues for the next meeting will
need to be brought to the attention of the Minister of Gatherings or one of
his/her aides to be added to the agenda. This will need to be done no less than
2 days before the scheduled meeting. Issued brought forward after this deadline
will be added to the agenda of the next scheduled meeting unless it is a
crucial or time sensitive topic. Once the agenda for the meeting is compiled
and approved, it will be posted on the website.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

